{"name":"Martyr","type":"class","_id":"martyrclass001","img":"icons/magic/symbols/cross-red-white.webp","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Martyr understands that suffering is the ultimate path to self-realization. They obtain their powers through a profound connection to either the Sun or the Moon, aligning with paths of Mercy or Vengeance.</p><h3>Hit Points</h3><ul><li><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d10 per Martyr level</li><li><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 10 + your Constitution modifier</li><li><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d10 (or 6) + your Constitution modifier per Martyr level after 1st</li></ul><h3>Proficiencies</h3><ul><li><strong>Armor:</strong> Light armor, Medium armor, Shields</li><li><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons, Greatsword, Maul, Heavy Crossbow</li><li><strong>Tools:</strong> None</li><li><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom</li><li><strong>Skills:</strong> Choose two from Athletics, Intimidation, Medicine, Persuasion, Religion, and Survival</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Class Module","levels":1,"identifier":"martyr","hitDie":"d10","hitDieUsed":0,"advancement":[{"_id":"advancement001","type":"HitPoints","title":"Hit Points","icon":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/hit-points.svg","configuration":{},"value":{}},{"_id":"advancement002","type":"ItemGrant","title":"Proficiencies","icon":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/proficiencies.svg","configuration":{"items":["Compendium.dnd5e.rules.z9FR2izCp5KZlCY9","Compendium.dnd5e.rules.CCQ49Gv1ddLKaXsQ"],"optional":false,"spell":null},"value":{},"level":1},{"_id":"advancement003","type":"AbilityScoreImprovement","title":"Ability Score Improvement","icon":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/ability-score-improvement.svg","configuration":{"fixed":{},"points":2,"cap":2},"value":{},"level":4},{"_id":"advancement004","type":"AbilityScoreImprovement","title":"Ability Score Improvement","icon":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/ability-score-improvement.svg","configuratio